<title>USA: MAPCO acquires 2 propane marketers.</title>
<headline>MAPCO acquires 2 propane marketers.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said its Thermogas Co business unit acquired independent propane marketing companies in Wisconsin and Colorado for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Gas Depot Inc of Rice Lake, Wis., and Bison Propane of Fairplay, Colo., will add 1,600 customers along with annual sales of 1.4 million gallons, according to Doug Rinke, president of Thermogas.</p>
<p>Thermogas is the fourth largest retail propane distributor in the U.S., with 350,000 customers in 14 states.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
